# Local visual-review scratch harnesses (Playwright against a running Storybook
# or `dev:mock`).
#
# ONE pattern, not a list of names. This was four named prefixes — shot, measure,
# probe, preview-shot — and six more had escaped anyway: band, verify,
# overlay-audit, list-compare, list-measure, preview-drawer-shot. Every design
# session writes another one-off prober and nobody names it after the list.
#
# Nothing the project actually needs is a dotfile `.mjs` at this root, so the
# whole shape can go.
.*.mjs
